| **CNN Baseline (Grayscale)** | 0.5332 | 0.57 | 0.1935 | 0.5200 |
| **AND Fusion Baseline (Grayscale)** | 0.6702 | 0.54 | 0.1978 | 0.5158 |
| `and_fusion_w16_linear_alpha0.2` | 0.6992 | 0.53 | 0.1989 | 0.5188 |
| `and_fusion_w16_linear_alpha0.4` | 0.7236 | 0.51 | 0.1997 | 0.5228 |
| `and_fusion_w16_linear_alpha0.6` **(Best)** | **0.7255** | 0.48 | 0.2010 | 0.5285 |
| `and_fusion_w16_linear_alpha0.8` | 0.7253 | 0.48 | 0.2064 | 0.5537 |
| `and_fusion_w16_linear_alpha1.0` | 0.7251 | 0.48 | **0.2087** | **0.5846** |
| `and_fusion_w32_linear_alpha0.4` | 0.7238 | 0.51 | 0.1997 | 0.5228 |
